{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/pulls/4","id":4799405158,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUuyodc8AAAABHhEcZg","html_url":"https://github.com/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/pull/4","diff_url":"https://github.com/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/pull/4.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/pull/4.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/issues/4","number":4,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"CS-001: pinned Lean baseline preparation; formal checks NOT_RUN","user":{"login":"lijiabao1998","id":332928950,"node_id":"U_kgDOE9gXtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/332928950?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998","html_url":"https://github.com/lijiabao1998","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Outcome\nKnown-proof reproduction package prepared; **formal proof replay is NOT_RUN**. This draft does not claim a verified theorem, held-out synthesis success, novelty, or CS-001 completion.\n\nRefs #3. Base: `1688c473bc06bf3b04c40b63b3428ed23443bef6`; governance pin unchanged: `9c3ae2dbaa1c814f3ef451c041dedfe3b77d926f`.\n\n## Included evidence\n- Six fresh queries in four categories after round start, primary-source reading, exact scope comparison, frozen specification and admission before experiments.\n- VeriSoftBench task 477, `Term.constFold_equiv`, from pinned `verified-compiler` source; source SHA-256 `2454c074170e8f2ca8e05b1339678457a5873a50307d4e2c1e1c1e585ca02a85`.\n- Source/license provenance, original source and full MIT license; upstream proof deliberately seen and labeled known-proof reproduction.\n- Offline-only Lean 4.18.0 replay harness, exact-target axiom audit, seven boundary probes, deliberately false theorem and admitted-proof controls, optional declaration-closure probe.\n- 12 Python harness tests PASS. Independent offline subprocess checks confirm absent/nonexistent toolchain → NOT_RUN and altered source → hash mismatch. This is artifact review, not independent proof checking.\n- Reviewer-identified reporting hazard fixed: core proof status and closure status are separate; unavailable/failed closure cannot yield top-level PASS.\n\n## Actual execution limits\nNo Lean/lake toolchain was present. Polling the official binary download returned `automatic approval review was cancelled`; the exact call was stopped without retry or an alternate download route. Subsequent read-only inspection found no download or matching process. Lean repository build, target audit, false rejection, boundary checks and semantic dependency closure are all NOT_RUN. Zero Lean trials, $0 paid cost, no GPU or model API.\n\nSource inventory is one module, implicit Init, zero external Lake packages. The upstream metadata's 12 dependencies / depth 3 are not locally reproduced measurements.\n\n## Validation\nPinned governance `validate` PASS and `check-diff` PASS for 29 changed paths, one admitted scope, zero changed problem cards. CI checks metadata only and cannot certify Lean proofs. No main write or merge.\n\n## Review entry points\n- `runs/20261009T103941763440Z-codex-CS-001/RESEARCH_REPORT.md`\n- `runs/20261009T103941763440Z-codex-CS-001/FROZEN_SPEC.json`\n- `runs/20261009T103941763440Z-codex-CS-001/independent_harness_review.json`\n- `problems/CS-001/experiments/lean-baseline-r1/README.md`\n\nA later authorized, freshly admitted round needs an existing official Lean 4.18.0 toolchain to execute the preserved probes. Parent problem remains OPEN.","created_at":"2026-10-09T10:50:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T10:50:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"37f619750ed8f5b32f30f888cff3b5cf46891506","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/pulls/4/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/pulls/4/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/issues/4/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lijiabao1998/FrontierComputerScience/statuses/8e21cd467c8aeae3c56f44c95e7f6df7103ec403","head":{"label":"lijiabao1998:codex/CS-001-lean-baseline-20261009t103941763440z","ref":"codex/CS-001-lean-baseline-20261009t103941763440z","sha":"8e21cd467c8aeae3c56f44c95e7f6df7103ec403","user":{"login":"lijiabao1998","id":332928950,"node_id":"U_kgDOE9gXtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/332928950?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998","html_url":"https://github.com/lijiabao1998","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lijiabao1998/orgs","repos_url":"https: